Forge Ordnance Frames - exosuit models (forge-frames.bundle)

The four exosuits are adapted from these Sketchfab models. Each was posed with its arms down, scaled to its height, given
one baked texture set, lined on the inside with a padded wall, and cut into hinged back, arm and leg plates. Changes were
made; the authors do not endorse this mod.

Assault frame (frame-m15) - "Halo 5 Infiltrator" by Abel (abel76)
  https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/halo-5-infiltrator-3cd75c718dde402fa54805399b710200
  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 (CC BY-NC 4.0) http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

Tank frame (frame-m16) - "BOT MECHA Warrior 3d by Oscar Creativo" by OSCAR CREATIVO (oscar_creativo), www.oscarcreativo.co
  https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/bot-mecha-warrior-3d-by-oscar-creativo-34850bfe441642788154c4a8a0bd60e4
  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 (CC BY-NC 4.0) http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

Firepower frame (frame-m17) - "spartan helioskrill" by photon (that one larry) (Professor_E12)
  https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/spartan-helioskrill-5ef6e0bb32ce4d47a620c1bd4ac74e2e
  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0) http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Recon frame (frame-m18) - "Halo 5 Noble Armor Thingy" by Abel (abel76)
  https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/halo-5-noble-armor-thingy-7f769c05a8db4a1ab69653ace60d114e
  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 (CC BY-NC 4.0) http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

Firepower frame's rocket launcher (frame-rocket-pod) and rocket (frame-rocket) - generated by the mod's author with Meshy (Premium subscription, owned by the author; no attribution required) and
  reduced to game meshes for this mod.

Frame picker icons (Assets/icons) are renders of the four frame models above and carry the same credits and licences.
Cockpit art (Assets/hud) was generated by the mod's author with ChatGPT; no attribution required.

Effects: the effect bundle forge-frames-fx.bundle is rebuilt from Unity Asset Store packs; its packs and licences are listed in fx-licences.forge next to it.
